{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"4f8204ba5d03970edbbc1821ef3ab2273a7f1047f06bac980e2a9e5e83e5e422"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:176cab5be56aaace9755af844d27e2f1d1254b118d3c0305b693b58c87020054","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Possibly because he's trying to cut back on caffeine and prefers fresh juice.","evidence":"[D21:12 | 9:18 pm on 26 August, 2022] John: Yes, tomorrow is my day off. Do you have any suggestions on how to spend tomorrow?\n[D21:14 | 9:18 pm on 26 August, 2022] John: I don't mind meeting up, but why Starbucks? Maybe we can have a beer somewhere?","itemId":"urn:uuid:0c4f3762-9f18-5ebd-a950-e61fa141eb68","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9b32ae029e8db80b0b44291bee4b4eb8a00621f6a3c3f1a3b98e3680d9916b9b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Why didn't John want to go to Starbucks?","referenceAnswer":"Possibly because he likes to drink beer on his days off.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9b32ae029e8db80b0b44291bee4b4eb8a00621f6a3c3f1a3b98e3680d9916b9b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}